    <string name="blk_social_title">%1$s: your 30 minutes for today</string>
    <string name="blk_social_body">Why am I opening this? You get one 30-minute session per day. It ends 30 minutes after you start, or at midnight if that comes first. Leaving and coming back does not pause or reset it. You can cancel now at no cost.</string>
